  "notes": "Used for the official issuance of orders, warnings, and directives by authorities. Carries a formal, authoritative tone.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {警報|けいほう}を{発令|はつれい}する: to issue a warning\n- {命令|めいれい}を{発令|はつれい}する: to issue an order\n- {避難|ひなん}{勧告|かんこく}が{発令|はつれい}される: an evacuation advisory is issued\n- {緊急|きんきゅう}{事態|じたい}{宣言|せんげん}を{発令|はつれい}する: to declare a state of emergency\n\nUSAGE:\n- {災害|さいがい} (natural disasters) — weather warnings, evacuation orders\n- {軍事|ぐんじ} (military) — orders, mobilization\n- {行政|ぎょうせい} (government) — official directives, personnel transfers\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {発表|はっぴょう}: announcement (more general, less authoritative)\n- {公布|こうふ}: promulgation (of laws)\n- {通達|つうたつ}: official notice/circular",
